%% Figure 7 — Role-aware Dashboard and Monitoring
flowchart LR
  User([Signed-in user]) --> Dashboard[Fiori role-aware Dashboard]
  Dashboard --> Reads[Read scoped Bugs, status metrics\nand authorized workload data]
  Reads --> Role{Resolved business role}

  Role -- Tester --> Tester[Created by me\nNeed my input\nRetest required]
  Role -- Developer --> Developer[Assigned work\nCurrent action items\nPersonal workload]
  Role -- PM --> PM[All lifecycle-status metrics\nPending assignment and overdue\nDeveloper workload]

  Tester --> Tile[Select tile or focus item]
  Developer --> Tile
  PM --> Tile
  Tile --> List[Fiori List Report\nApply canonical filter and auto-search]

  PM --> AiChoice{Open AI Activity?}
  AiChoice -- Yes --> AiMetrics[Read sanitized 30-day metrics\nrequests, outcomes, latency\nand review decisions]
  AiChoice -- No --> PM
  AiMetrics --> AiDialog[Display read-only AI Activity dialog]

  classDef action fill:#eef5ff,stroke:#2b88d9,color:#172b4d;
  classDef decision fill:#f2edff,stroke:#7f65c5,color:#172b4d;
  classDef role fill:#ecf8f1,stroke:#398b63,color:#172b4d;
  class User,Dashboard,Reads,Tile,List,AiMetrics,AiDialog action;
  class Role,AiChoice decision;
  class Tester,Developer,PM role;
